# "Whenever another permanent leaves the battlefield": a token counts (it leaves, then ceases to exist) and so does any player's
# permanent. Turn two: Bot2's Lightning Bolt kills one of Bot1's Spirit tokens: one counter (2/2). Turn four: Bot2's Strip Mine is
# sacrificed to destroy Bot1's Swamp: the Strip Mine leaving and the Swamp leaving are two permanents, two more counters: a 4/4.

[Bot1 Deck]
Swamp
Mox Pearl
Mox Pearl
Mox Jet
Mox Ruby
Super Shredder
Lingering Souls
Swamp x12

[Bot2 Deck]
Mountain
Lightning Bolt
Strip Mine
Mountain x12

